# Conformance probe pack for ruling 19 of spec 0.18: `element` placement does
# not count `when <locator> present` lines, which name no position (ruling
# 23 of 0.9). Public. One kind, selected when b/@a is present. The `when`
# line for b comes before the lines of a, so a is placed first.
format  conformance-cond-element-when
version 0.18.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    xml
root    msg
kind    k
when    b/@a  present
element a
field   probe.x  a/@x  int
element b
field   probe.y  b/@y  int
